# KidsQuest

Monorepo: `apps/mobile` (Expo **SDK 57**), `server` (Express :3001), `packages/shared`.

- Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) and [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](../../docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) before structural changes.
- Expo docs: https://docs.expo.dev/versions/v57.0.0/ — never unversioned.
- New types/constants live in `packages/shared`, then `npm run build -w @kidsapp/shared`.
- User-facing copy is Hebrew (`apps/mobile/lib/i18n.ts`, server `error` strings). RTL via `lib/rtl.ts`.
- Kid login needs family invite code + username + PIN. Do not invent a different auth scheme.
- No test suite; verify with `dev:server` + `dev:mobile`. Production: [deploy/vm/DEPLOY.md](../../deploy/vm/DEPLOY.md).
